= Using the wcharacter class =

* [#intro Introduction]
* [#isxxx Analyzing Characters]
* [#toxxx Transforming Characters]
* [#inset Member of a Set]


[=#intro]
== Introduction ==

The [../classes/html/classwcharacter.html wcharacter class] provides static methods for evaluating and manipulating wide characters.


[=#isxxx]
== Analyzing Characters ==

Methods are provided for determining if a wide character is alphabetic, alphanumeric, lower case, upper case, etc.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@../../examples/wcharacter-isxxx.cpp@
}}}
}}}


[=#toxxx]
== Transforming Characters ==

Methods are also provided for transforming the wide character to upper or lower case, and to 7-bit ascii, by clearing the higher order bits.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@../../examples/wcharacter-toxxx.cpp@
}}}
}}}


[=#inset]
== Member of a Set ==

An isInSet() method is also provided which returns true if the specified wide character is a member of the specified set of wide characters and false otherwise.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@../../examples/wcharacter-inset.cpp@
}}}
}}}

